course: dictionary
lesson: 7949
title: Reborn: born again, or starting anew
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: The word reborn is made of two parts. Re- means again, and born means brought into life. So reborn means born again, or made to live again. Read the context: «The old park was reborn after the new playground opened.» A park cannot be born, so reborn here means it came back to life with new energy.
explain: Religion lessons use reborn in a deeper way. «Hindus believe the soul is reborn many times until it is finally freed.» Here reborn means the soul comes back in a new body after death. Christians who say they are «born again» believe they have started a new life of faith.
explain: Check your meaning by swapping it into the sentence. Try "started again" or "came back to life". If it still makes sense, your meaning is probably right. If it does not, look again at the words around it for clues.
fact: Reborn means born again, or made to live again or start a new life.
fact: The prefix re- means again, so reborn is like saying born again.
fact: In religion, Christians who say they are born again believe they have started a new life of faith in Jesus.
fact: In Hinduism and Buddhism, people believe a soul can be reborn in a new body after death.
fact: Reborn can also mean full of new energy or hope, as if starting again.
exercise: «The old park was reborn after the new playground opened.» What does reborn mean here? | Torn down and thrown away | *Full of new energy, as if starting again | Painted blue only | Born in a hospital
exercise: Priya says Hindus believe the soul is «reborn» in a new body. What does this mean? | The soul stays in one body forever | The soul is a fixed flame in a candle | The soul goes to school | *The soul comes back in a new body after death
exercise: In the word reborn, the prefix re- means what? | Not | Very big | Under | *Again
test: «The phoenix rose from the ashes, reborn.» What does reborn mean in this sentence? | Was burned to dust forever | *Came back to life | Ran away | Fell asleep
test: Which word means the same as reborn in «Christians who say they are reborn believe they have started a new life of faith»? | Sleepy | Empty | *Born again | Frozen
exam: Which idea does reborn show in Hinduism and Buddhism? | A child growing taller | A cake being baked | A park being painted green | *A soul being reborn in a new body after death
